<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{% block title %}CatalogTest — Главная{% endblock %}</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: #1a202c;
            padding: 32px 20px 64px;
        }
        .container { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; }

        .hero {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 36px 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .hero p { color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 720px; }
        .badges { margin-top: 14px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea22, #764ba222);
            color: #5a3d99;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 28px 0 14px;
            padding-left: 8px;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .card-link {
            display: block;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.97);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 22px 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
            transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
        }
        .card-link:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
        }
        .card-link .icon {
            width: 44px; height: 44px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .icon-blue   { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #4a5fcf); }
        .icon-green  { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669); }
        .icon-purple { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6d28d9); }
        .icon-orange { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #d97706); }
        .icon-pink   { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ec4899, #be185d); }
        .icon-teal   { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #14b8a6, #0d9488); }
        .icon-red    { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #b91c1c); }
        .icon-indigo { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #4338ca); }
        .card-link h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #1a202c; }
        .card-link p  { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.5; }
        .card-link .url {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: #667eea;
            background: #f3f4ff;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .quick-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
        .qa-btn {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            padding: 9px 16px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            border-radius: 999px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: background 0.15s ease;
        }
        .qa-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.28); }

        pre.cmd {
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
            color: #e2e8f0;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin-top: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        pre.cmd b { color: #fbbf24; }

        .stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 14px;
        }
        .stat {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .stat .v { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; }
        .stat .l { font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 2px; }

        footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

    <div class="hero">
        <h1>📊 CatalogTest — панель управления</h1>
        <p>
            Бенчмарк каталога тарифов: сравнение трёх схем хранения
            (<b>flat</b> — широкая таблица, <b>rel</b> — EAV, <b>jsonb</b> — JSONB + GIN)
            на 100 свойствах (70 bool + 20 int + 10 string) и до 1 000 000 тарифов.
        </p>
        <div class="badges">
            <span class="badge">PHP {{ constant('PHP_VERSION') }}</span>
            <span class="badge">Symfony {{ constant('Symfony\\Component\\HttpKernel\\Kernel::VERSION') }}</span>
            <span class="badge">PostgreSQL 16</span>
            <span class="badge">FrankenPHP</span>
            <span class="badge">Doctrine ORM</span>
        </div>

        <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat"><div class="v">3</div><div class="l">схемы БД</div></div>
            <div class="stat"><div class="v">100</div><div class="l">свойств</div></div>
            <div class="stat"><div class="v">70/20/10</div><div class="l">bool/int/string</div></div>
            <div class="stat"><div class="v">≤ 1M</div><div class="l">тарифов</div></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">🌐 Веб-интерфейс</div>
    <div class="grid">

        <a class="card-link" href="/search">
            <div class="icon icon-blue">🔍</div>
            <h3>Поиск тарифов</h3>
            <p>CRITERIA-генератор и OR-поиск по всем трём схемам. Сводный отчёт по времени выполнения.</p>
            <span class="url">/search</span>
        </a>

        <a class="card-link" href="/search/run?plan=1">
            <div class="icon icon-green">⚡</div>
            <h3>Запуск бенчмарка (API)</h3>
            <p>JSON-эндпоинт: прогоняет OR-поиск по flat/rel/jsonb и возвращает SQL + EXPLAIN ANALYZE.</p>
            <span class="url">/search/run?plan=1</span>
        </a>

        <a class="card-link" href="/benchmark">
            <div class="icon icon-purple">📈</div>
            <h3>Дашборд бенчмарка</h3>
            <p>Снимок последнего прогона: p50/p95/max, размеры таблиц, критерии.</p>
            <span class="url">/benchmark</span>
        </a>

        <a class="card-link" href="/benchmark.pdf">
            <div class="icon icon-orange">📄</div>
            <h3>PDF-отчёт</h3>
            <p>Скачиваемый PDF с результатами последнего бенчмарка (snapshot + статистика).</p>
            <span class="url">/benchmark.pdf</span>
        </a>

        <a class="card-link" href="/health">
            <div class="icon icon-teal">💚</div>
            <h3>Health-check</h3>
            <p>Статус приложения и БД в JSON-формате. Подходит для мониторинга.</p>
            <span class="url">/health</span>
        </a>

        <a class="card-link" href="/api/criteria">
            <div class="icon icon-pink">🎯</div>
            <h3>Критерии поиска</h3>
            <p>Сгенерированный набор критериев: bool/int/string-условия + сводка.</p>
            <span class="url">/api/criteria</span>
        </a>

    </div>

    <div class="section-title">🌱 Сидирование каталога (консольные команды)</div>
    <div class="grid">

        <div class="card-link" style="cursor:default;">
            <div class="icon icon-green">📋</div>
            <h3>FLAT — широкая таблица</h3>
            <p>102 колонки: id, name + 70 bool + 20 int + 10 string. PK — единственный индекс.</p>
            <pre class="cmd">php bin/console app:seed-catalog <b>--variant=flat</b> -c 100000 <b>--truncate</b></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="card-link" style="cursor:default;">
            <div class="icon icon-blue">🔗</div>
            <h3>REL — EAV (3 таблицы)</h3>
            <p>tariff_rel (1M) + tariff_property (100) + tariff_value (100M) с индексами по типам.</p>
            <pre class="cmd">php bin/console app:seed-catalog <b>--variant=rel</b> -c 100000 <b>--truncate</b></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="card-link" style="cursor:default;">
            <div class="icon icon-purple">🧩</div>
            <h3>JSONB — JSON + GIN</h3>
            <p>tariff_jsonb: id, name, props JSONB + GIN(jsonb_path_ops) на props.</p>
            <pre class="cmd">php bin/console app:seed-catalog <b>--variant=jsonb</b> -c 100000 <b>--truncate</b></pre>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="section-title">🏁 Бенчмарк</div>
    <div class="grid">

        <div class="card-link" style="cursor:default;">
            <div class="icon icon-orange">⏱️</div>
            <h3>Запуск бенчмарка</h3>
            <p>5 итераций по каждому варианту → var/benchmark.json + var/benchmark-report.md.</p>
            <pre class="cmd">php bin/console app:benchmark <b>-i 5</b> -o var/benchmark.json -r var/benchmark-report.md</pre>
        </div>

        <div class="card-link" style="cursor:default;">
            <div class="icon icon-red">🚫</div>
            <h3>Без EXPLAIN ANALYZE</h3>
            <p>Ускоряет прогон, если планы запросов не нужны.</p>
            <pre class="cmd">php bin/console app:benchmark -i 5 <b>--no-plan</b></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="card-link" style="cursor:default;">
            <div class="icon icon-indigo">🗃️</div>
            <h3>Миграции Doctrine</h3>
            <p>Применить миграции и подготовить схему БД с нуля.</p>
            <pre class="cmd">php bin/console doctrine:migrations:migrate <b>-n</b></pre>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="section-title">⚡ Быстрые действия</div>
    <div class="hero" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);">
        <p style="margin-bottom:10px;"><b>Открыть эндпоинты:</b></p>
        <div class="quick-actions">
            <a class="qa-btn" href="/search/run?plan=0" target="_blank">▶ flat + rel + jsonb</a>
            <a class="qa-btn" href="/search/run?plan=1" target="_blank">▶ + EXPLAIN</a>
            <a class="qa-btn" href="/health" target="_blank">💚 Health</a>
            <a class="qa-btn" href="/benchmark" target="_blank">📊 Дашборд</a>
            <a class="qa-btn" href="/benchmark.pdf" target="_blank">📄 PDF</a>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:18px; margin-bottom:6px;"><b>Полезные docker-команды:</b></p>
        <pre class="cmd" style="background:#1a202c;">
docker compose exec php php bin/console app:seed-catalog --variant=rel -c 100000 --truncate
docker compose exec php php bin/console app:benchmark -i 5
docker compose logs -f php
docker compose exec postgres psql -U app -d app -c "SELECT count(*) FROM tariff_flat;"
        </pre>
    </div>

    <footer>
        CatalogTest · Symfony {{ constant('Symfony\\Component\\HttpKernel\\Kernel::VERSION') }} · PHP {{ constant('PHP_VERSION') }} · PostgreSQL 16<br>
        <span style="opacity:0.7;">Endpoints: /, /health, /search, /search/run, /benchmark, /benchmark.pdf, /api/criteria</span>
    </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
